//------------------------------------------------------------------------
// INFO:
// BonusIndex:
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0 = Increase in percentage terms the "Experiencie"
// 1 = Increase in percentage terms the "Master Experencie"
// 2 = Increase in percentage terms the "Item Drop Rate"
// 3 = Increase the chance to drop items of "ItemDrop.txt" (x/1000000)
// 4 = Increase the chance to drop items "Excelente" (x/1000000)
// 5 = Increase the chance to drop items "Anciente" (x/1000000)
// 6 = Increase the amount of "Goblin Point" Gain
// 7 = Increase the amount of "Reset" Gain
// 8 = Increase the amount of "Master Reset" Gain
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------

0
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Schedule
// When each bonus event starts. An event may have several rows (several times).
//   Bonus event: Number of the bonus event (0 to 29). The next parts use it.
//   Year: The year when the bonus starts. * means every year.
//   Month: The month when the bonus starts. * means every month.
//   Day: The day of the month when the bonus starts. * means every day of the month.
//   Day of the week: -1 Every day | 1 Sunday | 2 Monday | 3 Tuesday | 4 Wednesday | 5 Thursday | 6 Friday | 7 Saturday
//   Hour: The hour when the bonus starts. * means every hour.
//   Minute: The minute when the bonus starts. * means every minute.
//   Second: The second when the bonus starts. * means every second.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~29]        [*/1970~9999]    [*/1~12]    [*/1~31]    [*/1~7]      [*/0~23]    [*/0~59]    [*/0~59]
//  EventIndex    Year             Month       Day         DayOfWeek    Hour        Minute      Second
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    0             *                *           *           7            21          30          0           //Test bonus exp
    0             *                *           *           1            21          30          0           //Test bonus exp
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Messages and Time
// The messages and the length of each bonus event.
//   Bonus event: Number of the bonus event (0 to 29).
//   Start message: Number of the message (Message file) sent to everyone when the bonus starts. * sends none.
//   End message: Number of the message (Message file) sent to everyone when the bonus ends. * sends none.
//   Lasts (seconds): Seconds the bonus lasts.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~29]        [Number]        [Number]        [Number]
//  EventIndex    StartMessage    FinalMessage    BonusTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0             *               *               6400         //Test bonus exp (2 hrs)
end

2
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Bonuses
// What each bonus event gives. Several rows may be active at once; the filters narrow them down.
//   Bonus event: Number of the bonus event (0 to 29).
//   Bonus: What to increase. The percentages add to the normal amount (50 makes it 1.5 times); the x/1000000 ones add that part of the missing chance; the Goblin Points, resets and master resets ones are added as they are.
//   Value, Free: Amount of the bonus for a free account.
//   Value, VIP 1: Amount of the bonus for a VIP 1 account.
//   Value, VIP 2: Amount of the bonus for a VIP 2 account.
//   Value, VIP 3: Amount of the bonus for a VIP 3 account.
//   Only this item: Only for this item (item drop bonuses). * for any.
//   Item level: Only for items of this level. * for any.
//   Only on this map: Only for players on this map. * for any.
//   Only this monster: Only for this monster. * for any.
//   Monster level, at least: Only for monsters of at least this level. * for any.
//   Monster level, at most: Only for monsters of at most this level. * for any.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~29]        [0~8]         [0~1000000]       [0~1000000]       [0~1000000]       [0~1000000]       [*/0~8191]    [*/0~15]     [*/0~114]    [Number]        [*/0~150]          [*/0~150]
//  EventIndex    BonusIndex    BonusValue_AL0    BonusValue_AL1    BonusValue_AL2    BonusValue_AL3    ItemIndex     ItemLevel    MapNumber    MonsterClass    MonsterLevelMin    MonsterLevelMax
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    0             0             50                50                50                50                *             *            *            *               *                  *                  // + 50% exp extra (Happy Hour)
end